---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Pick a Time
description: Pick a time for your twenty-minute call with 406 Front Desk, and see exactly what the AI front desk does before you get on it.
pageCss: start
permalink: /start/schedule/
noindex: true
# Set once the Remotion ChatDemo render is committed to src/assets/video/.
# Empty = the video block is skipped rather than shipping a broken <video>.
preCallVideo: ""
---
{% from "partials/icons.njk" import icon %}
<header class="lp-header">
  <a href="/" class="lp-logo"><em>406</em> Front Desk</a>
  <a href="tel:+14068400404" class="lp-call">(406) 840-0404</a>
</header>

<!-- ── HERO ── -->
<section class="hero hero-tight">
  <div class="hero-inner fade-in">
    <div class="hero-badge">Last step</div>
    <h1>Got it. Now <em>pick your time.</em></h1>
    <p>Grab whatever slot suits you below. You'll get a confirmation with everything you need — and nothing you don't.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ── THE CALENDAR ── -->
<section class="booking" id="book">
  <div class="section-inner">
    <div class="booking-card fade-in">
      <!-- GHL booking widget — 406 20-minute demo.
           Never add loading="lazy": form_embed.js can't hook a lazy iframe and it collapses to zero height. -->
      <iframe
        src="https://links.406frontdesk.com/widget/bookings/406-20-minute-demo"
        style="width:100%;min-height:720px;border:none;overflow:hidden"
        scrolling="no"
        id="406-20-minute-demo"
        title="Book a 20-minute call with 406 Front Desk"
      ></iframe>
      <script src="https://link.msgsndr.com/js/form_embed.js"></script>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ── WHILE YOU'RE HERE: THE DEMO LINE ── -->
<section class="hear">
  <div class="section-inner">
    <div class="hear-card fade-in">
      <div class="hear-copy">
        <div class="section-label">Before The Call</div>
        <h2 class="section-title" style="text-align:left;">Don't take our word for it. Call it.</h2>
        <p class="section-sub">Our own business line is answered by the same AI we build for clients. It's live right now. Call it, try to trip it up, ask it something awkward — that's the demo.</p>
      </div>
      <a href="tel:+14068400404" class="hear-btn">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M22 16.92v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.18 2 19.79 19.79 0 0 1-8.63-3.07 19.5 19.5 0 0 1-6-6 19.79 19.79 0 0 1-3.07-8.67A2 2 0 0 1 4.11 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.72c.13.96.36 1.9.7 2.81a2 2 0 0 1-.45 2.11L8.09 9.91a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.27-1.27a2 2 0 0 1 2.11-.45c.91.34 1.85.57 2.81.7A2 2 0 0 1 22 16.92z"/></svg>
        Call (406) 840-0404
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{% if preCallVideo %}
<!-- ── PRE-CALL VIDEO ── -->
<section class="precall">
  <div class="section-inner">
    <div class="section-head fade-in">
      <div class="section-label">Sixty Seconds</div>
      <h2 class="section-title">This is what it actually looks like.</h2>
      <p class="section-sub">A customer messages after close. Watch what happens instead of nothing.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="precall-frame fade-in">
      <video controls playsinline preload="metadata" poster="/assets/img/og-image.png">
        <source src="{{ preCallVideo }}" type="video/mp4" />
        Your browser can't play this video. Call <a href="tel:+14068400404">(406) 840-0404</a> and hear it instead.
      </video>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
{% endif %}

<!-- ── THE OBJECTIONS, ANSWERED UP FRONT ── -->
<section class="objections">
  <div class="section-inner">
    <div class="section-head fade-in">
      <div class="section-label">Asked Every Time</div>
      <h2 class="section-title">The three things everyone asks.</h2>
      <p class="section-sub">Answered here so the call doesn't have to spend twenty minutes on them.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="obj-grid fade-in">
      <div class="obj-cell">
        <h3>"Isn't it going to sound like a creepy robot?"</h3>
        <p>Call the line above and judge for yourself — that's why the number is on this page. It talks like a receptionist who knows the business, because that's what it's set up with. If it ever isn't right for your customers, that's a reason not to buy, and we'd rather you find out now.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="obj-cell">
        <h3>"What if it says something wrong?"</h3>
        <p>It's built to say "I don't know, let me get you to someone who does" instead of inventing an answer. Anything it isn't certain about becomes a handoff to you, not a guess to your customer. That guardrail goes into every build on purpose.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="obj-cell">
        <h3>"Am I locked into something?"</h3>
        <p>Month to month. Thirty days' notice, no minimum term. Everything about the pricing is on the <a href="/pricing/">pricing page</a> before you talk to anyone — including the parts that cost extra.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<footer class="lp-footer">
